      "text": "PHYLOGENETIC REALITY:\n  Archaea are more closely related to Eukaryotes than to Bacteria.\n  The three-domain tree was established by Carl Woese (1977) using 16S rRNA.\n  Before 1977: Two kingdoms (prokaryote / eukaryote). This was wrong."
